  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In treasure yellow heaven, Fang Yuan shops for a star path offensive killer move and settles on this one from memory rather than Star Lord Wan Xiang’s spiral drill star spear.",
      "chapters": [
        667
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "char_star_lord_wan_xiang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He remembers Little Immortal Xing Luo rising in the five regions war by using icy stardust to accumulate battle wealth. When he meets her selling goods, she is still poor and does not yet offer icy stardust; he buys her ice path killer move icy yarn and her small star path killer move six-nine stardust instead.",
      "chapters": [
        668
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "xing-luo-fame",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_little_immortal_xing_luo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan reconstructs the move.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "move-reconstruction",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using the light of wisdom Gu, he deduces icy stardust.",
      "chapters": [
        669
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "move-reconstruction",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_wisdom_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When she rose, she was extremely poor and used her self-created icy stardust to accumulate wealth in the five regions war. Fang Yuan had meant to buy an earlier version from her; seeing icy yarn and six-nine stardust, he judged those two moves the foundation of that self-created killer move. He then creates icy drill stardust as his own variant: smaller range, much greater power, and already slightly past icy stardust after he folds in Dou Min Jun’s inheritance and a star Gu that raises star path attack power. Full activation can fire a water-vat-sized starlight lump up to six times; larger lumps move slower because denser stardust collides and spends energy. Tai Bai Yun Sheng prices icy drill stardust at least four immortal essence stones in treasure yellow heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        670
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "icy-drill-variant",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_du_min_jun_inheritance",
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With icy drill stardust, light illusion bat wings, and hair armor in normal form, Fang Yuan’s battle strength sits at the upper tier of rank six.",
      "chapters": [
        681
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "icy-drill-variant",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "During Hei Lou Lan’s flying blade noise tribulation he casts icy drill stardust repeatedly and still cannot clear the danger with those mortal moves alone.",
      "chapters": [
        684
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "icy-drill-variant",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan"
      ]
    }
  ],
